 Square","source_kind":"business_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The official page describes an outdoor commercial complex but does not provide universal operating hours; individual businesses set their own hours.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"lfc-first-weekend-08-lake-forest-library","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Lake Forest Library","title":"Add the Public Library to Your Map","subtitle":"Saturday afternoon · Find an off-campus workspace","notes":"Step inside before Saturday closing, locate seating and computers, and save the library’s address for a future downtown study session.","short_summary":"Identify a second library option with published weekend hours and public services.","evidence_claim":"Lake Forest Library lists its address as 360 E Deerpath Road and offers Wi-Fi, computers, scanning, faxing, printing, copying, and weekend operating hours.","source_url":"https://www.lakeforestlibrary.org/services-contact","source_title":"Services & Contact | Lake Forest Library","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Published hours are Saturday 9 a.m.–5 p.m. and Sunday 1–5 p.m.; confirm the day’s status on the library site before leaving campus.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"lfc-first-weekend-09-brown-hall","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Brown Hall","title":"Test a Quieter Campus Base","subtitle":"Sunday morning · Compare study environments","notes":"Walk through Brown Hall and compare its quiet and collaborative spaces with the library before selecting a weekday fallback.","short_summary":"Broaden the weekend beyond the main library by locating another documented study setting.","evidence_claim":"Lake Forest College’s commuter guide says Brown Hall contains a variety of collaboration and quiet spaces, most available without a reservation.","source_url":"https://www.lakeforest.edu/student-life/commuter-students","source_title":"Commuter Students | Lake Forest College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Most spaces are described as available without reservations, but the source does not publish weekend building-access hours.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"lfc-first-weekend-10-lily-reid-holt-memorial-chapel","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Lily Reid Holt Memorial Chapel","title":"Finish with a Campus-Map Check","subtitle":"Sunday afternoon · Confirm one final landmark","notes":"Find the chapel on Middle Campus, then use the official map to retrace how North, Middle, and South Campus connect.","short_summary":"Close the sequence by converting the weekend’s walks into a mental map of campus.","evidence_claim":"Lake Forest College’s official campus facilities map identifies Lily Reid Holt Memorial Chapel as a named building on Middle Campus.","source_url":"https://www.lakeforest.edu/Public/OCM/map/campus_map.pdf","source_title":"Campus Facilities Map | Lake Forest College","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The official map verifies the building and location but does not state public or weekend interior-access hours; treat this as an exterior waypoint.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
